/**
 * Convert an ISO 8601 duration string (e.g. "PT1H30M", "P2DT3H") to total seconds.
 *
 * Approximations used: 1 week = 7 days, 1 month ≈ 30.42 days (2628288 sec),
 * 1 year = 365 days. Not calendar-exact.
 *
